1
00:00:00,424 --> 00:00:02,674
[UNDER THE INFLUENCE OF GIANTS'
"MEANINGLESS LOVE" PLAYS ON STEREO]

2
00:00:02,843 --> 00:00:04,883
(Kurt:)Okay, now you're starting
to make me mad.

3
00:00:06,138 --> 00:00:09,888
A Homo habilis discovering
his opposable thumbs says, "What?"

4
00:00:10,851 --> 00:00:12,271
(Leonard:)- What?
- Ha-ha.

5
00:00:16,773 --> 00:00:18,193
(Leonard:)I think I've made my point.

6
00:00:18,358 --> 00:00:21,358
Yeah? How about I make a point
out of your pointy little head?

7
00:00:21,528 --> 00:00:25,488
(Sheldon:)Let me remind you, while my moral support
is absolute, in a physical confrontation...

8
00:00:25,657 --> 00:00:27,327
(Sheldon:)...I will be less than useless.

9
00:00:27,492 --> 00:00:29,452
(Leonard:)There's not going to be a confrontation.

10
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,540
(Leonard:)In fact, I doubt
if he can even spell confrontation.

11
00:00:35,417 --> 00:00:38,377
(Sheldon:)C-O-N...

12
00:00:38,754 --> 00:00:40,544
(Sheldon:)Frontation.

13
00:00:40,923 --> 00:00:44,053
- Kurt, put him down this instant.
- He started it.

14
00:00:44,217 --> 00:00:47,097
(Penny:)I don't care, I'm finishing it.
Put him down.

15
00:00:47,262 --> 00:00:48,842
(Penny:)Fine.

16
00:00:50,307 --> 00:00:52,937
(Kurt:)You're one lucky little leprechaun.

17
00:00:54,269 --> 00:00:56,019
(Sheldon:)He's a hobbit.

18
00:00:56,188 --> 00:00:58,018
I got your back.

19
00:00:58,857 --> 00:01:00,067
Leonard, are you okay?

